# fdfpv-backup.service: the nightly backup of the VM, pulled to the owner's
# DESKTOP (a systemd --user unit there, not on the VM). Runs backup.sh as
# installed by the commands in README.md "Backups", with the deploy's SSH
# key. Run by fdfpv-backup.timer.
#
# Measured 2026-10-08: one run took 3.1 s wall clock for a 5.0 MB backup
# (board.dump 3.5 MB, metrics.db 5.4 MB before gzip). No memory ceiling:
# the local work is tar, gzip and pg_restore --list on files this small.
